01:23:09.114 --> 01:23:12.693
I couldn't do it, because I knew
how sad it would make you.


01:23:12.905 --> 01:23:16.353
And if that is giving up,
then I gave up.


01:23:17.614 --> 01:23:19.320
I gave up.


01:23:19.530 --> 01:23:23.855
