You killed him, you psycho!


01:31:05.656 --> 01:31:09.235
- You killed him.
- I did?


01:31:10.281 --> 01:31:14.903
Just stay away, okay?
Just stay away.


01:31:15.115 --> 01:31:19.772
You killed him because you're such
a spoiled, little brat -


01:31:19.990 --> 01:31:23.238
